OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer's ex-partner denies
OL,4,Aracial abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former partner of a pro-Donald
OL,7,FTrump social media influencer racially
OL,8,Fabused two sisters before aiming pepper
OL,9,Fspray at them near a London Underground
OL,10,Fstation, a court has heard.
OL,12,FPhilipp Ostermann, 38, allegedly said
OL,13,F"you bloody Indians" to Sabba and
OL,14,FMarium Javed after Melissa Rein Lively
OL,15,Fstumbled over a pram carrying one of
OL,16,FSabba's children.
OL,18,FThe confrontation near Bond Street
OL,19,Fstation left one of the sisters feeling
OL,20,Fshe was "not welcome in my home", City
OL,21,Fof London Magistrates' Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
